def height(node):
    if node is None:
        return 0
    return 1 + max(height(node.left), height(node.right))
```

Example answer: ```python
def contains(node, target):
    if node is None:
        return False
    if target == node.time:
        return True
    if target < node.time:
        return contains(node.left, target)
    return contains(node.right, target)
```

